        {
            "title": "Now Available - Lunar pack, 20% off!",
            "date": "2013-03-19 11:33:00",
            "url": "http://store.steampowered.com/news/10177/",
            "content": " \nLunar pack is Now Available on Steam and is 20% off!<br><br>Includes two great Indie games Lunnye Devitsy and Wake from the developers of Really Big Sky.<br><br>Lunnye Devitsy is the story of an alien who falls from the moon onto a huge mountainside on the planet below. Explore strange locations, aid mysterious characters and find your way home.<br><br>Wake is the story of an engineer trapped on a sinking ship. Navigate through the ship however you want to find your way to the surface above, but avoid the ship's corrupted security system!<br><br>*Offer end March 26th at 10AM Pacific Time<br><a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/233510/\"><img src=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/233510/capsule_231x87.jpg\" style=\" float: left; margin-right: 12px; height: 87px; width: 231px;\"></a><a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/233530/\"><img src=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/233530/capsule_231x87.jpg\" style=\" float: left; margin-right: 12px; height: 87px; width: 231px;\"></a>\t\t\t\t"
